<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Ref: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><font size="2">Re: File Reference {!Case.Baggage_File_Reference__c}</font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you for returning the documents requested.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We have assessed your claim, and I am pleased to offer you <b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(112, 110, 107);"><i>AUD </i></b><b><i>{!Case.Recovery_Value__c} or {!Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}</i></b><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(112, 110, 107);"><i> </i></b><b><i>Frequent Flyer points</i></b>, as full and final settlement for the <b><i>loss of/damage to</i></b> your baggage.&nbsp;As your journey was governed by the Civil Aviation (Carrier’s Liability) Act of 1959 as amended, the liability for <b><i>loss/damage</i></b> of a passenger’s checked baggage is limited to AUD1600.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Please complete and sign the enclosed Release Form and return it at your earliest convenience. When returning the signed Release Form, please ensure to reply to this email, to ensure your documentation is attached to your file and processed accordingly. Once this is received I will arrange your payment.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Once again, please accept my apologies for being unsuccessful in locating your baggage. I am more than happy to provide you with any additional information in assisting you with lodging a claim for the difference with your insurer.</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>